#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""DKT + Temporal Affect v3: a controlled test of affect HISTORY, not a promised gain.

A fixed v2.1 LSTM summarizes skill/response history. Independent small readouts
receive identical behavioral history and differ only in available affect history.
No residual adapter, new affect forecaster, joint backbone tuning or new labels.

Run:  python DKT_Affect_Temporal_v3.py --config config.json
Test: python DKT_Affect_Temporal_v3.py --self-test
"""
